OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786493896
OL,3,CFifty police chiefs call for PM to
OL,4,Cprevent early release of PC Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FFifty police chiefs have signed a
OL,8,Fletter urging Andy Burnham to use
OL,9,F"every lawful option" to prevent the
OL,10,Fearly release of PC Andrew Harper's
OL,11,Fkillers.
OL,13,FIn the open letter to the prime
OL,14,Fminister, coordinated by the National
OL,15,FPolice Chiefs' Council, policing and
OL,16,Flaw enforcement leaders also called
OL,17,Ffor more protections for victims'
OL,18,Ffamilies and communities when
OL,19,Foffenders' release arrangements change.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786493896
OL,3,CFifty police chiefs call for PM to
OL,4,Cprevent early release of PC Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FPC Harper, 28, was killed after being
OL,8,Fdragged behind a car as three teenage
OL,9,Fsuspects fled a quad bike theft in
OL,10,FBerkshire in 2019.
OL,12,FTwo of his killers were due to be
OL,13,Ffreed in January under plans to
OL,14,Frelease about 5,000 prisoners early to
OL,15,Fease overcrowding in prisons in
OL,16,FEngland and Wales. The proposals
OL,17,Fprompted concern from the public and
OL,18,FPC Harper's family, who said they were
OL,19,F"more angry than ever".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786493896
OL,3,CFifty police chiefs call for PM to
OL,4,Cprevent early release of PC Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FOn Tuesday, the prime minister said he
OL,8,Funderstood the "depth of concern
OL,9,Facross the country" over the case.
OL,11,FHe said he had asked Justice Secretary
OL,12,FAlex Norris to develop plans to
OL,13,Fincrease prison capacity and keep more
OL,14,Fserious offenders in custody, adding
OL,15,Fthat he was "increasingly confident"
OL,16,Fthe men would not be freed early.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786493896
OL,3,CFifty police chiefs call for PM to
OL,4,Cprevent early release of PC Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FIn their letter, police chiefs and
OL,8,Fother law enforcement leaders welcomed
OL,9,Fthe intervention but said the case
OL,10,Fraised broader questions about the
OL,11,Fgovernment's efforts to tackle prison
OL,12,Fovercrowding. They called on the prime
OL,13,Fminister to "establish an additional
OL,14,Fpublic protection safeguard" for the
OL,15,Fmost serious offenders.
OL,17,FThose who signed the letter included
OL,18,FMet Commissioner Sir Mark Rowley,
OL,19,FGreater Manchester Chief Constable
OL,20,FStephen Watson and National Crime
OL,21,FAgency Director General Graeme Biggar.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786493896
OL,3,CFifty police chiefs call for PM to
OL,4,Cprevent early release of PC Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FTheir letter said: "When the state
OL,8,Fasks people to run towards danger on
OL,9,Fbehalf of the public, they should be
OL,10,Fable to trust that the justice system
OL,11,Fwill stand behind them when the worst
OL,12,Fhappens.
OL,14,F"Pc Andrew Harper's case also raises a
OL,15,Fwider question.
OL,26,@oD@TOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786493896
OL,3,CFifty police chiefs call for PM to
OL,4,Cprevent early release of PC Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,F"When someone is sentenced for an
OL,8,Fexceptionally serious offence, how
OL,9,Fmuch confidence can victims, bereaved
OL,10,Ffamilies and the public place in that
OL,11,Fsentence if subsequent changes to
OL,12,Frelease arrangements result in an
OL,13,Foffender being released significantly
OL,14,Fearlier than originally anticipated?"
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
