PN,30707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786493896
OL,3,CFifty police chiefs call for PM to
OL,4,Cprevent early release of PC Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FThe question extends "far beyond
OL,8,Fpolicing", they said, adding that
OL,9,F"families across the country are now
OL,10,Ffacing the distress of learning that
OL,11,Foffenders may be released earlier than
OL,12,Fthey understood when sentence was
OL,13,Fpassed".
OL,26,@oD@VOUpD@IO]qD@AOUuD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/14
