PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786493896
OL,3,CFifty police chiefs call for PM to
OL,4,Cprevent early release of PC Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FThe letter, which was signed by police
OL,8,Fchiefs of forces across England,
OL,9,FScotland, Wales and Northern Ireland,
OL,10,Fadded: "Officers and staff understand
OL,11,Fthat the law must be applied as it
OL,12,Fstands. But they will question what
OL,13,Fmessage this sends about the value
OL,14,Fplaced on their service and sacrifice
OL,15,Fwhen they put themselves in harm's way
OL,16,Fto protect others."
OL,26,@rD@HOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/14
