CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786493896
OL,3,CFifty police chiefs call for PM to
OL,4,Cprevent early release of PC Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FThe intervention from police chiefs
OL,8,Fcomes after the mother of PC Harper
OL,9,Ftold ITV News on Monday she would like
OL,10,Fa meeting with Burnham to discuss the
OL,11,Fearly release of her son's killers.
OL,13,FShe said she was "more angry than
OL,14,Fever" and no one from the government
OL,15,Fhad been in touch with her about their
OL,16,Fearly release.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30710
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786493896
OL,3,CFifty police chiefs call for PM to
OL,4,Cprevent early release of PC Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FShe then received a call from Downing
OL,8,FStreet, in which they told her the PM
OL,9,Fis "trying to do everything that he
OL,10,Fcan and he's feeling more confident
OL,11,Fthat something can be done", she told
OL,12,FGood Morning Britain on Tuesday.
OL,14,FBut she noted: "Nothing has been done,
OL,15,Fnothing has been found yet, until it
OL,16,Fhappens here we sit."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
