PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786493896
OL,3,CFifty police chiefs call for PM to
OL,4,Cprevent early release of PC Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FThe prime minister said on Tuesday
OL,8,Fthat he did not want "to see a single
OL,9,Fprisoner released early", insisting he
OL,10,Fhad been "pressing every single day to
OL,11,Fgo further" in limiting the number of
OL,12,Finmates freed under measures aimed at
OL,13,Feasing prison overcrowding.
