OL,3,CFifty police chiefs call for PM to
OL,4,Cprevent early release of PC Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FNorris, the new justice secretary, has
OL,8,Fbeen asked to fast-track proposals to
OL,9,Fcreate "more headroom" in the prison
OL,10,Fsystem, including through deporting
OL,11,Fmore foreign offenders, finding a
OL,12,Fsolution for people on indeterminate
OL,13,Fsentences and using cells previously
OL,14,Fholding female inmates to accommodate
OL,15,Fmale offenders.
OL,26,@qD@HOUqD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
