PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786493896
OL,3,CFifty police chiefs call for PM to
OL,4,Cprevent early release of PC Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FThe prime minister ordered a review of
OL,8,Fthe early release scheme under the
OL,9,FSentencing Act shortly after taking
OL,10,Foffice, but while changes were
OL,11,Fannounced to prevent rapists and
OL,12,Fpaedophiles being released early, the
OL,13,Fmeasures did not cover PC Harper's
OL,14,Fkillers.
OL,16,FTwo out of three of PC Harper's
OL,17,Fkillers, Albert Bowers and Jessie
OL,18,FCole, are set to be released next year
OL,19,Fhalfway through their 13-year
OL,20,Fsentences, after being convicted of
OL,21,Fmanslaughter in 2020.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30714
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786493896
OL,3,CFifty police chiefs call for PM to
OL,4,Cprevent early release of PC Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FBefore this year's Sentencing Act,
OL,8,Fthey would have served two-thirds of
OL,9,Ftheir term.
OL,11,FBurnham previously said he had "pushed
OL,12,Fthe very limits" in the changes he had
OL,13,Fmade to the early release scheme, but
OL,14,Fhas now said he can go further.
OL,16,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,17,Four political experts are across all
OL,18,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,19,Fto the latest episode below...
